Each team has {{ team_size }} viewers, each holding a private board of objects (a shape and a color in a cell of a {{ grid_size }}x{{ grid_size }} grid). Exactly one object is on every board of a team, and other objects are on some boards but not all, so the viewers talk on a shared link channel to find the one they all hold, and every member must submit it.{% if two_teams %} Two teams compete on the same boards each round: among teams whose every member submits the correct object, the one that sent the fewest characters wins.{% else %} The characters sent are the score to minimize.{% endif %} The run lasts {{ round_count }} rounds.
